Blast Corps is a game by Rare/Nintendo. This project is unaffiliated with
Rare or Nintendo and includes no ROM, extracted game assets, or save data.
Game code and resources are generated locally from a user-supplied ROM.

Control glyph artwork was supplied by the user in two image atlases.
config/control-atlas.json records exact hashes and extraction boxes;
include/control_atlas_data.h contains the extracted control artwork.
The host-code GPL notice does not relicense this supplied artwork; its
original author/license has not been identified.

